  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。スライスして　サンドウィッチにはさめば　アクセントに　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓴맛이 나는 식재료. 슬라이스해서 샌드위치에 넣으면 악센트가 되어 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有苦味的食材。切片後夾進三明治可收畫龍點睛之效。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût amer. Coupé en tranches, il ajoute une note agréable à un Sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Scheiben geschnitten verleiht diese bittere Zutat einem Sandwich einen interessanten Geschmacksakzent.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cortado en tiras, aporta un regusto amargo a cualquier bocadillo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente amaro. Tagliato a fette sottili è perfetto per impreziosire un panino imbottito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An ingredient with some bitterness. When sliced, it adds a nice accent to a sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。スライスして　サンドウィッチにはさめば　アクセントに　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有苦味的食材。切成片放进三明治当中能够起到提味作用。",
